{"id":"1a4ff326755a9822","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-graph-theorem.md","title":"Graph Theorem","display":"thm-graph-theorem — Graph Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-graph-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-graph-theorem"],"display":"thm-graph-theorem — Graph Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-thm-selector-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14.4 pp.50-51 / PDF 59-60","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-graph-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-graph-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-graph-theorem — Graph Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ae8d5f86d63b8a4\" href=\"?note=2ae8d5f86d63b8a4\" title=\"68-thm-selector-theorem\">68-thm-selector-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14.4 pp.50-51 / PDF 59-60"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_k\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k\">\\(\\mathcal F_k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_f^{(k)}:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_f^{(k)}:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\)</span> 的特征函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_f^{(k)}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\0&amp;(\\vec x,y)\\notin f.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_f^{(k)}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\0&amp;(\\vec x,y)\\notin f.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\chi_f^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\chi_f^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>14.4 Graph Theorem，印刷 pp.50–51 / PDF pp.59–60。正向用有限计算见证，反向对单值的 RE 图使用 Selector Theorem；若 f 全定义，直接计算 f(x) 再与 y 比较便能判定其图。条件“全定义”不可删去：一般偏递归函数的图仅保证 RE。公式中的函数图与关系通过声明的元组串接对应，避免把图的 arity 隐藏在解释中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-selector-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"2ae8d5f86d63b8a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-selector-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathcal F_k$。$\\mathcal F_k$ 与 $\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见所列直接依赖。$\\chi_f^{(k)}:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是 $\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)$ 的特征函数，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$y\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_f^{(k)}:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_f^{(k)}(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle):=\\begin{cases}1&(\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\0&(\\vec x,y)\\notin f.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Gr}_k(f)\\in\\mathrm{RE}^{(k+1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;(f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\chi_f^{(k)}\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}).","display":true}],"bytes":1816,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-graph-theorem]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-graph-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-graph-theorem|thm-graph-theorem — Graph Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2","913d52943499d039","a82d826d433dcff3","2ae8d5f86d63b8a4"]}